From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:30:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] params: drop the vram row from preset 2

msm_dpu has no device wide GPU memory counter, so the vram row reads the
game's drm-resident-memory through 0009 and says nothing a game session
needs. The horizontal bar also runs past the Pocket MICRO 2 screen with
it in.
---
 src/overlay_params.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/overlay_params.cpp b/src/overlay_params.cpp
index 4dd813d..c05f7a1 100644
--- a/src/overlay_params.cpp
+++ b/src/overlay_params.cpp
@@ -1317,7 +1317,7 @@ void presets(int preset, struct overlay_params *params, bool inherit) {
          add_to_options(params, "cpu_stats", "1");
          add_to_options(params, "gpu_stats", "1");
          add_to_options(params, "ram", "1");
-         add_to_options(params, "vram", "1");
+         add_to_options(params, "vram", "0");
          add_to_options(params, "battery", "1");
          add_to_options(params, "hud_no_margin", "1");
          add_to_options(params, "gpu_power", "1");
